From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cera <cera@local>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:16:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] build: upgrade uniffi_bindgen to 0.32.2

